# XTDK LLVM 19 toolchain staged by setup.py (large third-party download, never in-tree)
third_party/xpu/backend/llvm19/
third_party/_xtdk_llvm19/
# Package-level LICENSE / PROVENANCE — copied into the tree root by setup.py's
# stage step.  They are **package metadata, not tree content**: the repository
# root already carries the LICENSE, and the package's own copy travels inside
# the tarball (MIT: "shall be included in all copies").  Without these entries
# a `git add -A` after an install would sweep them into a commit.
third_party/xpu/LICENSE
third_party/xpu/PROVENANCE
third_party/xpu/PROVENANCE.json
third_party/xpu/python/triton/backends/_tables/
.comate/

